  "app_id": 2835570,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Shoot Your Friends Take a seat at the new 4-way multiplayer table. Bargain. Beg. Betray. Become the ultimate victor. Walk away rich. 12-Gauge Action Play Russian roulette with a 12-gauge. Cause shotguns just feel better. Literally Mindblowing Gameplay 15 to 20-minute intense playtime. Enter the arena, go three rounds against The Dealer, and walk away with the prize. Or don't. Immersive Atmosphere Welcome to the underground nightclub, where metal railings pulse to the beats of forgotten drum machines. Meet Your Match Face off against The Dealer, playing the odds same as you. No tricks. Can you beat him at his own game? Double or Nothing Press your luck in the new Double or Nothing mode. How long can you last? New Items New items for the Steam release. Just cause we love you. Seven tracks. No misses. Are you ready? The Steam edition of Buckshot Roulette also includes the full soundtrack, created by Mike Klubnika.",
    "zh-Hant": "請朋友吃子彈 最多能容納四名玩家的新型賭桌正式推出，歡迎就座。在討價還價、乞求生路、互相背叛的循環中成為最終贏家，抱走高額獎金吧。 12 號口徑的行動 用 12 號口徑霰彈槍玩俄羅斯輪盤。因為霰彈槍感覺更好。 真正爆腦的遊戲 15 到 20 分鐘的緊張遊戲時間。進入競技場，與莊家大戰三回合，贏獎離開。或者再也無法出去。 身臨其境的氛圍 歡迎來到地下夜總會，這裡的金屬欄杆隨著被遺忘的鼓機節拍而晃動。 與你的對手見面 與莊家對決，莊家的賠率與你相同。沒有花招。你能在他自己的遊戲規則下打敗他嗎？ 加倍或是放棄 在全新的加倍或放棄模式中試試你的運氣。你能堅持多久？ 新物品 Steam 版提供新物品。因為我們愛你。 七首曲目。彈無虛發。你準備好了嗎？ Steam 版《Buckshot Roulette》還包括由 Mike Klubnika 創作的完整原聲音樂。",
    "zh-Hans": "射爆你的好友 加入全新的四人对战桌，讨价还价、乞求饶恕、背叛盟友，成为最终的赢家并满载而归！ 12 号口径的行动 用 12 号口径霰弹枪玩俄罗斯轮盘。因为霰弹枪感觉更好。 真正爆脑的游戏 15 到 20 分钟的紧张游戏时间。进入竞技场，与庄家大战三回合，赢奖离开。或者再也无法出去。 身临其境的氛围 欢迎来到地下夜总会，这里的金属栏杆随着被遗忘的鼓机节拍而晃动。 与你的对手见面 与庄家对决，庄家的赔率与你相同。不耍花样。你能在他自己的游戏规则下打败他吗？ 加倍或是放弃 在全新的加倍或放弃模式中试试你的运气。你能坚持多久？ 新物品 Steam 版提供新物品。因为我们爱你。 七首曲目。弹无虚发。你准备好了吗？ Steam 版恶魔轮盘还包括由 Mike Klubnika 创作的完整原声音乐。",
    "ja": "友を撃て 新たな4人用テーブルに座れ。取り引き、泣き付き、裏切り、唯一の勝者となれ。帰るときには金持ちだ。 12ゲージアクション 口径が12ゲージのショットガンでロシアンルーレットをしよう。ショットガンの方が爽快な気分になれる。 白熱のゲームプレイ ゲーム所要時間は15分から20分。アリーナに入り、ディーラーと3ラウンド戦い、賞金を手にして退出しよう…ただし、負けたら出られないぞ。 臨場感溢れる雰囲気 地下のナイトクラブに入ると、ドラムマシンのリズムに合わせて店内のあらゆる金属部品が振動している。 ガチンコ対決 小細工なしのガチンコ対決で、君と対等な立場のディーラーと勝負しよう。君はディーラーのゲームに勝てるかな？ ダブル・オア・ナッシング ダブル・オア・ナッシングモードで運試しをしよう。君はどこまで持ちこたえられるかな？ 新アイテム Steamリリース版に追加された新アイテム。私たちからのささやかなお礼です。 7曲全て楽しめる。準備はいいか？ Buckshot RouletteのSteam版には、Mike Klubnikaが手掛けた全てのサウンドトラックが収録されています。",
    "ko": "게임 친구들을 쏴버리십시오 새롭게 마련된 4인용 멀티플레이어 테이블에 앉아보시지요. 협상하십시오. 구걸하십시오. 배신하십시오. 최후의 승자가 되십시오. 부를 거머쥐고 떠나버리십시오. 12게이지 액션 12게이지 샷건으로 러시안 룰렛을 플레이하세요. 왜냐면 샷건이 더 멋지니까요. 말 그대로 정신이 아득한 게임플레이 플레이타임은 짧고 굵은 15 - 20분 가량이 됩니다. 아레나에 입장하여 딜러를 상대로 3라운드 게임을 벌인 뒤 상금을 들고 빠져나가십시오. 이기지 못하면 죽음 뿐. 몰입감을 선사하는 배경 메탈 레일이 잊혀진 드럼머신의 비트에 맞춰 약동하는 지하세계 나이트클럽에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 라이벌과 대면 당신과 똑같이 확률에 의지하고 있는 딜러와 승부를 벌이십시오. 속임수는 없습니다. 딜러의 게임에서 승리할 수 있을까요? 더블 아니면 꽝 신규 모드인 더블 아니면 꽝에서 당신의 운을 시험해 보십시오. 얼마나 버틸 수 있을까요? 신규 아이템 Steam 발매 기념 신규 아이템이 추가되었습니다. 저희는 여러분을 사랑하니까요. 총 일곱 곡이 빠짐 없이 수록되어 있습니다. 준비 됐나요? 벅샷 룰렛의 스팀판에는 Mike Klubnika가 제작한 사운드트랙이 전곡 포함됩니다"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot Your Friends </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat at the new 4-way multiplayer table. Bargain. Beg. Betray. Become the ultimate victor. Walk away rich. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12-Gauge Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play Russian roulette with a 12-gauge. Cause shotguns just feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Literally Mindblowing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 to 20-minute intense playtime. Enter the arena, go three rounds against The Dealer, and walk away with the prize. Or don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to the underground nightclub, where metal railings pulse to the beats of forgotten drum machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Your Match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against The Dealer, playing the odds same as you. No tricks. Can you beat him at his own game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double or Nothing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Press your luck in the new Double or Nothing mode. How long can you last?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New items for the Steam release. Just cause we love you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven tracks. No misses. Are you ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Steam edition of Buckshot Roulette also includes the full soundtrack, created by Mike Klubnika.</p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >請朋友吃子彈</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >最多能容納四名玩家的新型賭桌正式推出，歡迎就座。在討價還價、乞求生路、互相背叛的循環中成為最終贏家，抱走高額獎金吧。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12 號口徑的行動</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 用 12 號口徑霰彈槍玩俄羅斯輪盤。因為霰彈槍感覺更好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >真正爆腦的遊戲</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 到 20 分鐘的緊張遊戲時間。進入競技場，與莊家大戰三回合，贏獎離開。或者再也無法出去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >身臨其境的氛圍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 歡迎來到地下夜總會，這裡的金屬欄杆隨著被遺忘的鼓機節拍而晃動。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >與你的對手見面</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 與莊家對決，莊家的賠率與你相同。沒有花招。你能在他自己的遊戲規則下打敗他嗎？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >加倍或是放棄</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 在全新的加倍或放棄模式中試試你的運氣。你能堅持多久？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >新物品</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam 版提供新物品。因為我們愛你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >七首曲目。彈無虛發。你準備好了嗎？</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam 版《Buckshot Roulette》還包括由 Mike Klubnika 創作的完整原聲音樂。</p>",
    "zh-Hans": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/1dce4114e0bb41d133abd2cd469a1bb0.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/1dce4114e0bb41d133abd2cd469a1bb0.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/1dce4114e0bb41d133abd2cd469a1bb0.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >射爆你的好友</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入全新的四人对战桌，讨价还价、乞求饶恕、背叛盟友，成为最终的赢家并满载而归！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12 号口径的行动</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 用 12 号口径霰弹枪玩俄罗斯轮盘。因为霰弹枪感觉更好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >真正爆脑的游戏</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15 到 20 分钟的紧张游戏时间。进入竞技场，与庄家大战三回合，赢奖离开。或者再也无法出去。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >身临其境的氛围</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 欢迎来到地下夜总会，这里的金属栏杆随着被遗忘的鼓机节拍而晃动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >与你的对手见面</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 与庄家对决，庄家的赔率与你相同。不耍花样。你能在他自己的游戏规则下打败他吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >加倍或是放弃</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 在全新的加倍或放弃模式中试试你的运气。你能坚持多久？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >新物品</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam 版提供新物品。因为我们爱你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >七首曲目。弹无虚发。你准备好了吗？</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam 版恶魔轮盘还包括由 Mike Klubnika 创作的完整原声音乐。</p>",
    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >友を撃て</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新たな4人用テーブルに座れ。取り引き、泣き付き、裏切り、唯一の勝者となれ。帰るときには金持ちだ。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12ゲージアクション</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >口径が12ゲージのショットガンでロシアンルーレットをしよう。ショットガンの方が爽快な気分になれる。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >白熱のゲームプレイ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ゲーム所要時間は15分から20分。アリーナに入り、ディーラーと3ラウンド戦い、賞金を手にして退出しよう…ただし、負けたら出られないぞ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >臨場感溢れる雰囲気</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 地下のナイトクラブに入ると、ドラムマシンのリズムに合わせて店内のあらゆる金属部品が振動している。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ガチンコ対決</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小細工なしのガチンコ対決で、君と対等な立場のディーラーと勝負しよう。君はディーラーのゲームに勝てるかな？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ダブル・オア・ナッシング</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ダブル・オア・ナッシングモードで運試しをしよう。君はどこまで持ちこたえられるかな？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >新アイテム</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steamリリース版に追加された新アイテム。私たちからのささやかなお礼です。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7曲全て楽しめる。準備はいいか？</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buckshot RouletteのSteam版には、Mike Klubnikaが手掛けた全てのサウンドトラックが収録されています。</p>",
    "ko": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>게임 친구들을 쏴버리십시오</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >새롭게 마련된 4인용 멀티플레이어 테이블에 앉아보시지요. 협상하십시오. 구걸하십시오. 배신하십시오. 최후의 승자가 되십시오. 부를 거머쥐고 떠나버리십시오.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12게이지 액션</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12게이지 샷건으로 러시안 룰렛을 플레이하세요. 왜냐면 샷건이 더 멋지니까요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >말 그대로 정신이 아득한 게임플레이</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 플레이타임은 짧고 굵은 15 - 20분 가량이 됩니다. 아레나에 입장하여 딜러를 상대로 3라운드 게임을 벌인 뒤 상금을 들고 빠져나가십시오. 이기지 못하면 죽음 뿐.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/904177ed537036bc572348703bd20167.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >몰입감을 선사하는 배경</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 메탈 레일이 잊혀진 드럼머신의 비트에 맞춰 약동하는 지하세계 나이트클럽에 오신 걸 환영합니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/adbd6784cab14bff598e532681e2b2fc.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >라이벌과 대면</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 당신과 똑같이 확률에 의지하고 있는 딜러와 승부를 벌이십시오. 속임수는 없습니다. 딜러의 게임에서 승리할 수 있을까요?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a2446f48a145da24f4e90d5ff248e954.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >더블 아니면 꽝</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 신규 모드인 더블 아니면 꽝에서 당신의 운을 시험해 보십시오. 얼마나 버틸 수 있을까요?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/022b1bd517e5855bf8024ce5d59694b2.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >신규 아이템</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam 발매 기념 신규 아이템이 추가되었습니다. 저희는 여러분을 사랑하니까요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.poster.avif?t=1779135850\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.webm?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835570/extras/a82c68ff8171b1b26a070f20e3280fbb.mp4?t=1779135850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >총 일곱 곡이 빠짐 없이 수록되어 있습니다. 준비 됐나요?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 벅샷 룰렛의 스팀판에는 Mike Klubnika가 제작한 사운드트랙이 전곡 포함됩니다</p>"
